{"id":"n36555-1-10","stage":5,"title":"구상 · 构想","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36555-1-10-1","ko":"다음 시합에서는 이길 수 있을 것 같나?","zh":"你觉得下一场比赛能赢吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시합에서는","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이길","meaning":"赢，战胜，打败","explanation":"이기다：赢，战胜，打败；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같나?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"f623afa3b5ca8273","term":"이기다","zh":"赢，战胜，打败","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3","entryId":"71688","definition":"在打赌、竞赛或战争等中压制对手，创造佳绩。","pronunciation":["이기다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/938fbaf4cd7e514760ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36555-1-10-2","ko":"선수들과 작전 구상을 철저히 했으니 걱정 마십시오.","zh":"我们已经和队员们彻底商量好了战术，不用担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선수들과","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작전","meaning":"策略，战略","explanation":"작전：策略，战略","readings":[{"term":"작전","audio":"/audio/bfd3e15e030774b4daeb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76110","senseId":"1","lemma":"작전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구상을","meaning":"构想，设想","explanation":"구상：构想，设想；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"구상","audio":"/audio/5e659e5bcf5936ec32e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36555","senseId":"1","lemma":"구상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"철저히","meaning":"彻底地，透彻地，全面地","explanation":"철저히：彻底地，透彻地，全面地","readings":[{"term":"철저히","audio":"/audio/1b18115a1b9534d23ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25315","senseId":"1","lemma":"철저히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했으니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마십시오.","meaning":"不再做，停止","explanation":"말다：不再做，停止；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ시오：正式敬语的请求或命令语尾；通常与시合成십시오。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"bfd3e15e030774b4","term":"작전","zh":"策略，战略","audio":"/audio/bfd3e15e030774b4daeb.mp3","entryId":"76110","definition":"为实现某事而寻找所需的方法或实施措施；或指那样的方法或措施。","pronunciation":["작쩐"]},{"id":"5e659e5bcf5936ec","term":"구상","zh":"构想，设想","audio":"/audio/5e659e5bcf5936ec32e4.mp3","entryId":"36555","definition":"仔细地考虑今后工作的内容、规模、实现方法等；或指该想法。","pronunciation":["구상"]},{"id":"1b18115a1b9534d2","term":"철저히","zh":"彻底地，透彻地，全面地","audio":"/audio/1b18115a1b9534d23ebe.mp3","entryId":"25315","definition":"做某事细心谨慎而完美无缺地。","pronunciation":["철쩌히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不再做，停止","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"表示使无法做之前的话所指的行动。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0147d2c7423bf6ba6da7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.573,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36555","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.3997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们已经和队员们彻底商量好了战术，不用担心。","你觉得下一场比赛能赢吗？","那东西看起来简直像小牛，到底是什么动物呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你觉得下一场比赛能赢吗？","那东西看起来简直像小牛，到底是什么动物呢？","我们已经和队员们彻底商量好了战术，不用担心。"],"answer":2}]}
